Setup:
    Target: ESP32
    Pin 5 as RelayLock
    Pin 21 as AlarmBuzzer

Logic:
    String MasterPass = "7321"
    String UserInput = "7321" // টেস্ট করার জন্য ডিরেক্ট ভ্যালু দিলাম
    Number Attempts = 0

    Function CheckLock:
        If UserInput == MasterPass:
            Print "Vault Unlocked!"
            RelayLock status = High
            Attempts = 0
        Else:
            Print "Access Denied!"
            AlarmBuzzer status = High
            Wait 1000 ms
            AlarmBuzzer status = Low
            Attempts = Attempts + 1

    Always:
        If Attempts > 3:
            Print "System Locked! Intruder Alert!"
            AlarmBuzzer status = High
            Wait 10000 ms
        Else:
            Call CheckLock
            Wait 2000 ms